@startuml cu82
!theme plain
title CU82 — Generar Minuta de Inscripción

actor "Clerk (Gestor)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) requests generation of the registration memorandum for a property management.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Loads the deed, party, and property data (CU69).
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) checks the registry data (registration number, volume/folio, cadastral code, valuation).
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Validates that the fields required by the registry authority are complete.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) confirms generation of the registration memorandum.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Generates the official document with an identifier and enables printing on the standard form.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) files the testimony together with the memorandum at the property registry.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Records the filing date and registry entry number, and changes the status to "Presentado".
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The registry authority processes it and returns the registered testimony.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) records the receipt date, registration number, and registry notes (CU56).
System -> System : Clerk

@enduml
